    <innernamespace refid="namespacenewf4">newf4</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Typed integer vocabulary for <computeroutput>namespace <ref refid="namespacenewf4" kindref="compound">newf4</ref></computeroutput> (indices, monomial words, hashes, masks). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Declares the strongly-named integer aliases the rest of <computeroutput>gb-f4/</computeroutput> uses in place of bare <computeroutput><ref refid="classint" kindref="compound">int</ref></computeroutput>: <computeroutput>Index</computeroutput> numbers GB basis elements; <computeroutput>MonomialIndex</computeroutput> keys into the <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomial_hash_table" kindref="compound">MonomialHashTable</ref></computeroutput> with <computeroutput>0</computeroutput> reserved as the &quot;undefined&quot; sentinel; <computeroutput>MonomialInt</computeroutput> is one word of the encoded monomial stream and also the type used for cached degrees; <computeroutput><ref refid="res-schreyer-frame_8hpp_a46aff60fe9e7b02cb075b491f6e3af7b_1a46aff60fe9e7b02cb075b491f6e3af7b" kindref="member">ComponentIndex</ref></computeroutput> numbers free-module components; <computeroutput>HashInt</computeroutput> is the 64-bit hash returned by <computeroutput>MonomialHashFunction</computeroutput>; and <computeroutput>MonomialMask</computeroutput> is the 64-bit bitset <computeroutput><ref refid="f4-types_8hpp_a26f8bf3ae452faf485404829038ffe26_1a26f8bf3ae452faf485404829038ffe26" kindref="member">MonomialLookupTable</ref></computeroutput> uses for cheap divisibility pre-tests.</para>
<para>All six aliases compile to <computeroutput>int32_t</computeroutput> or <computeroutput>uint64_t</computeroutput>, but the distinct C++ names let the compiler reject calls that mix a <computeroutput>MonomialIndex</computeroutput> with an <computeroutput>Index</computeroutput> <mdash/> bugs that would silently misbehave with raw ints. Every other header in <computeroutput>gb-f4/</computeroutput> ultimately includes this one.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_monomial_hash_table_8hpp" kindref="compound">MonomialHashTable.hpp</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_monomial_lookup_table_8hpp" kindref="compound">MonomialLookupTable.hpp</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_monomial_view_8hpp" kindref="compound">MonomialView.hpp</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="_polynomial_list_8hpp" kindref="compound">PolynomialList.hpp</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
